<title>USA: FGIC qualifies Clyde-Savannah CSD for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies Clyde-Savannah CSD for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co. said on Wednesday it qualified Clyde-Savannah CSD, N.Y., $12.795 million school district bonds scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
